\par
Project using the Pico-W RP2040 board with VS Code, implementing a simple blinky program.\par
It includes as well the 'sample' program, used for the 'scientific debugging' part. The program implements the ShellSort to sort a list of numbers. Connect with a terminal to the VCOM of the USB port of the board.\par
