{\tc\tcl2 \v Build}
Project has {\f2 Debug} , {\f2 Release}  and {\f2 Test}  targets, using CMake Presets.\par
Configure: {
\par
\pard\plain \s40\li0\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid cmake --list-presets\par
cmake --preset Debug\par
cmake --preset Release\par
cmake --preset Test\par
}
\par
