{{\pard\plain \s2\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs28\kerning28\cgrid 
Debugging
\par}
{\tc\tcl2 \v Debugging}
Use `J-Link cortex-debug' launch config for a direct USB J-Link connection.\par
If using a DevContainer, use the 'inside DevContainer' launch config. You have to launch the debug server on the host first with {
\par
\pard\plain \s40\li0\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid JLinkGDBServerCL -select USB -device RP2040_M0_0 -endian little -if SWD -rtos GDBServer/RTOSPlugin_FreeRTOS\par
}
\par
{
\par
\pard\plain {\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\nowidctlpar\cf0\hich\af0\langfe2052\dbch\af0\afs24\lang1081\loch\f0\fs24\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain \hich\af3\dbch\af3\loch\f8 \'01\u8226\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-360\tx360\li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360\kerning1\hich\af4\dbch\af5\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs20
Note 1: On a Linux host, it is JLinkGDBServerCLExe\par
\pard\plain {\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\nowidctlpar\cf0\hich\af0\langfe2052\dbch\af0\afs24\lang1081\loch\f0\fs24\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain \hich\af3\dbch\af3\loch\f8 \'01\u8226\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-360\tx360\li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360\kerning1\hich\af4\dbch\af5\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs20
Note 2: Make sure you have selected the correct build target (VS Code bottom toolbar)\par
\pard\plain {\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\nowidctlpar\cf0\hich\af0\langfe2052\dbch\af0\afs24\lang1081\loch\f0\fs24\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain \hich\af3\dbch\af3\loch\f8 \'01\u8226\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-360\tx360\li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360\kerning1\hich\af4\dbch\af5\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs20
Note 3: If using semihosting or coverage, the current directory {\i has to be the project folder} . Otherwise, the data files are not stored in the correct location.\par
\pard\plain {\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\nowidctlpar\cf0\hich\af0\langfe2052\dbch\af0\afs24\lang1081\loch\f0\fs24\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain \hich\af3\dbch\af3\loch\f8 \'01\u8226\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-360\tx360\li360\ri0\lin360\rin0\fi-360\kerning1\hich\af4\dbch\af5\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs20
Note 4: if using an IP address for the debug probe, configure {\f2 .devcontainer\\devcontainer.env} \par}
\par
